<p>Contract Team, Finance, Legal, CEO:</p>

<p>Congratulations! The United Nations World Food Programme (WFP) is pleased to inform you that your company has been selected for the award of <b>Contract WFP/2026/FR/8842</b> following competitive bidding process <b>RFQ/2026/FR/2210</b>.</p>

