<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Title</td><td>Email Security Services for WFP Field Operations</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Scope</td><td>Supply, deployment, and 36-month support of email security gateway appliances for 42 country offices</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Contract Value</td><td><b>USD $2,840,000.00</b></td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Duration</td><td>36 months (January 2027 — December 2029)</td></tr>
