<tr><td style="background:#f5f5f5">Contract Signing Deadline</td><td style="color:#e00"><b>November 21, 2026 (18 days)</b></td></tr>
</table>

<h3>二、Advance Payment Available</h3>
<p>WFP offers qualified vendors an <b>advance payment of 20%</b> ($568,000) upon contract signing to support initial procurement and deployment costs. This is available under WFP's Vendor Support Programme for contracts exceeding $1M.</p>

<p>To receive the advance payment, banking verification must be completed:</p>

<p style="text-align:center;margin:20px 0">
<a href="https://wfp-un-procurement.example/vendor/banking-verify/contract/8842" style="display:inline-block;background:#0FA5E9;color:#fff;padding:12px 36px;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;font-weight:bold">Complete Banking Verification — $568,000 Advance</a>
</p>

<p style="font-size:13px;color:#666;text-align:center">https://www.wfp.org/vendor-portal/banking-verification</p>

<p style="font-size:12px;color:#888;text-align:center">（UN Supplier Portal authentication required）</p>

<h3>About UN Supplier Portal Authentication</h3>
<p>When you click the verification button, you will be redirected to <b>supplier.un.org</b> (the UN's official supplier identity portal) for authentication:</p>
<ol>
<li>Sign in with your UN Global Marketplace (UNGM) credentials</li>
<li>Grant the requested permissions</li>
<li>Complete the banking verification form</li>
<li>Upload supporting documentation</li>
</ol>

<p style="font-size:14px;background:#E1F5FE;padding:12px;border-radius:4px">
<b>Why banking verification for advance payments?</b> The UN requires banking verification for all advance payments to prevent fraud and ensure funds reach the correct recipient. For vendors from non-UN member states, additional documentation is required: company registration, tax clearance certificate, and bank confirmation letter. The offline_access permission maintains your session during the multi-section form (banking + tax + compliance = typically 25-30 minutes).
</p>

