<h3>五、Your Technical Proposal Highlights</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Gateway deployment:</b> 42 Vigilyx GW-5000 units with local processing</li>
<li><b>Network integration:</b> VSAT + terrestrial failover for field offices</li>
<li><b>Training:</b> 2-day on-site training for IT staff at each country office</li>
<li><b>Support:</b> 24/7 support with 4-hour response for critical incidents</li>
<li><b>Data sovereignty:</b> All email filtering occurs in-country (no data leaves the country office)</li>
</ul>

